      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sluggish diffusion and lattice distortion reduce the alloy's thermal expansion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sluggish diffusion and lattice distortion cause the elastic modulus to decrease more slowly with temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 600–1200°C, HfNbTaTiZr will have higher yield strength than Nb or NbTa tested under identical conditions.",
