      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 600–1200°C, the elastic modulus of HfNbTaTiZr will decrease less rapidly with temperature than that of Nb or NbTa.",
